# .cf-future

Places that work around Cloudflare's missing Vitest 5 support. Vite+ 1.0 bundles
Vitest 5.0.1; @cloudflare/vitest-plugin 1.3.5 supports only Vitest ^4.1.0. When
the plugin ships Vitest 5 support, work through the entries below and delete
each one as it is resolved.

## Watch

- cloudflare/workers-sdk PR #15500: [vitest-plugin] Support Vitest 5
- cloudflare/workers-sdk PR #15993: follow-up, Vitest-5-only
- cloudflare/workers-sdk issue #15618: Vitest 5 support

## Skipped

- *.spec.ts and *.e2e.ts
  Now: not set up. Skipped because full Workers support for Vitest 5 is missing.
  Then: add both test types.

## Workarounds

- apps/api/src/index.test.ts
  Now: tests the Hono app through app.request() under plain Vitest, outside workerd.
  Then: run it in the Workers runtime via @cloudflare/vitest-plugin, with bindings.

- vite.config.ts (test block)
  Now: plain Vitest config, no Workers pool.
  Then: add the Cloudflare Vitest plugin to the test config.
